', 'yDesc': "Uunguciinani wall' nalirruggluni callminek, yugmek, wall' pillerkaminek, caperrnariluku cucukillerkaq wall' caqatallerminek.", 'speakers': [], 'resourceID': '4'}, {'eTerm': 'Openness', 'eDesc': 'Willing to accept and consider new ideas, perspectiives, or experiences', 'yTerm': 'Allakaukinailnguq', 'yDesc': "Ciuniuriyugngaluni umyuartuuteksugngaluki-llu nutaarat pillerkat, qaillun tangvaumallrit, wall' callrit.", 'speakers': [], 'resourceID': '4'}, {'eTerm': 'Hesitation', 'eDesc': 'A temporary pause or delay in decision-making or action, often stemming fom uncertainty, doubt, or lack of confidence in choosing the best course of option', 'yTerm': 'Nasperturyaraq', 'yDesc': "Pillerkiuringnaqkuni wall' caqataquni arulaiqerluni wall' qariqerrluni, ancurtuami, asguranakngamiu, wall' ellminek kemyukenrilami cucukinritnayukluni assinranek.", 'speakers': [], 'resourceID': '4'}, {'eTerm': 'Coping Strategies', 'eDesc': 'Ways people deal with and manage stress, challenges or difficult emotions. These can include various actions, thoughts, or behaviors that help people navigate tough situations', 'yTerm': 'Qaillun Auluksaurcugngariyaraq', 'yDesc': "Yuut qaillun aulukitullrat umyuamun arcarillret, cakviurutet, wall' capernarqellriit umyuarniurutet.  Ilakluki ayuqenrilnguut callrit, umyuartuutet, wall' yuut ikayuutait qaillun ayagturallerkaatnun cakviungermeng.", 'speakers': [], 'resourceID': '5'}, {'eTerm': 'Healing', 'eDesc': 'The process of becoming healthy and whole again. It often involves recovery and improvement after a period of illness, trauma, or distress. ', 'yTerm': 'Mamyaraq', 'yDesc': "Calricaaraq tamalkuurcaraq-llu.  Aturnarqelartuq utumariyaraq assiriinallerkaq-llu naulluurraarluni, umyuaq akngirterrarcelluku, wall' arenqialliurraarcelluku.", 'speakers': [], 'resourceID': '5'}, {'eTerm': 'Support', 'eDesc': 'Assistance, encouragement, or comfort provided by others, such as friends, family, or a community. Support can be emotional, practical, or both', 'yTerm': 'Cingumayaraq', 'yDesc': "Allat ikayurluku, cingumaluku, wall' qarulluku, ukutun yugnikekngat, ilait, wall' nunalgutaita.  Cingumayugngauq umyuarakun, aipaqluku, wall' tamarkenka.", 'speakers': [], 'resourceID': '5'}, {'eTerm': 'Harm Reduction', 'eDesc': 'An approach focused on reducing  the risks of certain behaviors or conditions, without completely stopping all the behaviors themselves. Small changes over time can have major long-term effects.', 'yTerm': 'Ikgelicarluku akngirun', 'yDesc': "Ikeglingnaqluki aarnarqellriit ayuqucii wall' uitallra, taugaam tamalkuita arulaircetevkenaki aarnarqellriit atuqekngai.  Ikgenaki cimiryarait cakviurnarqelartut ak'anun.", 'speakers': [], 'resourceID': '5'}, {'eTerm': 'Habits', 'eDesc': 'Consistent, often unconscious, behaviors that people develop throughout their lives. Habits can be both positive and negative, influencing daily routines and lifestyle choices', 'yTerm': 'Piuryarat', 'yDesc': "Cimiyuinateng, amllerqunek elpeksuunaku, piciryarait yuut piciryaraksagutellrit yuucimegni. Piciryarat assiryugngaut wall' assiicugngaut, agtuumaluki cayarait yuuyarait-llu.", 'speakers': [], 'resourceID': '5'}, {'eTerm': 'Curable', 'eDesc': "When an illness is curable, it means that there is a treatment or intervention that can completely get rid of the illness. Imagine it like fixing a problem so that it foes away permanently, like successful, the illness is gone, and you don't have to worry about it coming back.", 'yTerm': 'Mamyugngalria', 'yDesc': "Naulluun mamyugngalriarukuni, kangingqerciquq yuungcaryugngaluni wall' naulluun arulaivkangnaqluku catairutlerkaanun tamalkuan. Tangruarluku kitugillerkaa arenqiallugutem ayagniartuq taqluni, iinrukiitellriatun pupik pitekluku. Iinruk calikuni naulluun catairuciiquq, peng'garnairulluni-llu tainqigtellerkaanek.", 'speakers': [], 'resourceID': '5'}, {'eTerm': 'Treatable', 'eDesc': 'When an illness is treatable, it means that there are ways to manage or alleviate the symptoms of the illness. Think of it like managing a chronic condition, such as diabetes. With ongoing treatment and lifestyle adjustments, you can control the symptoms and  live a healthy life, but the condition might not go away entirely', 'yTerm': 'Assiriyugngalria', 'yDesc': "Naulluun assiriyugngalria, auluksugngaciquq wall' ikegliyugngaciquq tamana naulluun, taugaam tamarmi catairucesciigaciiqngatuq. Umyuaqluku auluknarqellra ak'anun naulluun, saarralissiyaalriatun auk tequq-llu.  Yuungcarturaquni cali yuuciq kitugareskuni, auluknaqelarciquq cali yuuluaqernaqluni, taugaam tauna naulluun tamarmi assiringaituq", 'speakers': [], 'resourceID': '5'}, {'eTerm': 'Informal Supports', 'eDesc': 'Personal assistance and help that people receive from friends, family, or social networks', 'yTerm': 'Allat Cingumastet', 'yDesc': "Yuk ikayurcelluni cali ikayungqerrluni yugnikekngamiinek, ilaminek, wall' allanek ikayuritulinek.", 'speakers': [], 'resourceID': '6'}, {'eTerm': 'Community Resources', 'eDesc': 'Services, organizations, or facilities available within a community that provide support, assistance, or information to residents. These resources can include healthcare services, community centers, educational programs, and more. ', 'yTerm': 'Nunaitni ikayungcarviit', 'yDesc': "Kevgiurutet, quyungqalriit ikayurtet, wall' caliviit paivngalriit nunani cingumastenguluteng, ikayuriluteng, wall' nallunairiluteng yugnun. Makut ikayuutet ilangqersugngaut calricaram kevgiuriyaaraanek, nunat quyurrvigkaatnek, elitnauryaranek, allanek-llu.", 'speakers': [], 'resourceID': '6'}, {'eTerm': 'Protective Factors', 'eDesc': "Parts of a person's life or environment that increase their resilience and help them manage stress and difficulties. They contribute to a person's well-being and can act as a buffer against stressors.", 'yTerm': 'Qaunqiyaarat', 'yDesc': "Yuucim iliin wall' avatiin quyigikanircetlaraa pinirikanircelluku ikayurluku-llu aulukluku umyuarniurun capernarqellriit-llu. Ikayuutelartut yuum calricaraanun cayailkucilriatun-llu ayuqluku umyuarniurutkanun.", 'speakers': [], 'resourceID': '6'}, {'eTerm': 'Risk Factors', 'eDesc': "Parts of a person's life that increase the likelihood of negative outcomes or problems", 'yTerm': 'Aarnarqellriit', 'yDesc': "Yuum yucian iliin arcariluki assinrilnguut wall' arenqiallugutait.", 'speakers': [], 'resourceID': '6'}, {'eTerm': 'Treatment Plan', 'eDesc': "A detailed and structure strategy developed by healthcare professionals to address an individual's specific health or behavioral issues. It outlines the intended interventions, therapeutic approaches, and goals to achieve the desired outcomes", 'yTerm': 'Yuungcallerkam pillerkiuraa', 'yDesc': "Iinrivigmi calistet ayagnillrit apertumanqegcaraumalria atuyunarqellria-llu pillerkiuraq caliaqsugluku yuum calricaraa wall' arenqiallugutii. Pillerkiulartuq ikayullerkaanek, qaillun assiringcallerkaanek, egmirutekaanek-llu piyuutiin unakellerkaanek.", 'speakers': [], 'resourceID': '7'}, {'eTerm': 'Goals', 'eDesc': 'Broad, overarching statements that describe the desired results or changes a person aims to achieve. In the context of a treatment plan, goals provide a general direction for progress and improvement', 'yTerm': 'Egmiruutet', 'yDesc': "Qanerniarutet aperturiluteng iqukanek wall' cimirluki yuum piukekngai. Assirillerkam pillerkiuraani, egmirutekiulartut assirillerkam tunginun cali utumarillerkamun.", 'speakers': [], 'resourceID': '7'}, {'eTerm': 'Objective', 'eDesc': 'Specific, measurable, and time-bound steps or actions designed to achieve the broader goals outlined in a treatment plan. Objectives break down the goals into smaller, manageable components, making it easier to track progress and success.', 'yTerm': 'Picirkiurun', 'yDesc': "Apertuumanqegcaarluni, cuqcugngaluku, cali apertuutet taqlerkiurangqerrluteng wall' egmirutekait atuyunaqluteng yungcaryaraan pillerkiuraini.  Egmirutekat picirkiurutet-ggun atuyunarilartut ikeglillrit-ggun, auluksunarillrit-ggun, qacignarivkarluki cuqtellerkait assiriinaryaramun cali elluarillerkamun.", 'speakers': [], 'resourceID': '7'}, {'eTerm': 'Informed Consent', 'eDesc': 'Autonomy is closely tied to the concept of informed consent. Before any medical procedure or treatment, healthcare providers should provide patients with any available information about the types of help they are suggesting, including potential risks, benefits, and alternatives. ', 'yTerm': 'Nallunrirceciiyaraq', 'yDesc': "Ellminek ataniuryaram ayuqeqapigta nallunrirceciiyaraq.  Iinrivigmi cavailgatgu wall' yuungcarpailgatgu, calricaariurtet nallunaircetarkaugait yuungcarvigtellriit nallunaircelluki ayuqenrilngurnek ikayutekaitnek, ilaluki aarnarqutaitnek, ikayutekaitnek, allanek-llu piyugngallritnek. ", 'speakers': [], 'resourceID': '8'}, {'eTerm': 'Respecting Preferences', 'eDesc': 'Healthcare professionals should respect and consider the individual preferences and values of their patients. They must recognize that people may have diverse cultural, religious, or personal beliefs that influence their healthcare decisions.', 'yTerm': 'Qigcikluki Piyuutait', 'yDesc': "Calricaariurtet qigcikarkaugait cali umyuartuutekluki iinrivigtellriit piyuutait arcaqakekngait-llu.  Elitaqumaarkaugait yuut ayuqenrilngurnek yuuyarangqellrit, agayumaaciit, wall' ukverutait calricaaram pillerkiuryaraan tungiinun. ", 'speakers': [], 'resourceID': '8'}, {'eTerm': 'Shared Decision-Making', 'eDesc': 'Autonomy encourages providers to work together with their patients for all decision making rather than choosing what should be done about any identified problems alone. ', 'yTerm': 'Ikayuqulluteng Pillerkiuriyaaraq', 'yDesc': 'Ellminek ataniuriyaaram cingumalarai calricaariurtet calillgutkesqumaaluki iinrivigtellriit ilakluki pillerkiurillerkait kiingan arenqiallugutait auluklerkai tangvagpeknaku. ', 'speakers': [], 'resourceID': '8'}, {'eTerm': 'Confidentiality', 'eDesc': 'Respecting autonomy includes ensuring the confidentiality of patient information. Patients should feel confident that their personal health information will be kept private unless they give clear permission for it to be used in specific ways.', 'yTerm': 'Qalarutkumaarkaunrilnguut', 'yDesc': "Qigcikiyaraq ellminek ataniuriyaaramek ilangqertuq qalarutkarkaunritellranek iinrivigtellriim nallunairutainek.  Iinrivigtellriit kemyunakarkaugait calricaaraata nallunairutait qanrutkumaarkaunritellritnek apterraarpailgan at'uusqelluku qaillun.", 'speakers': [], 'resourceID': '8'}, {'eTerm': 'Refusal of Treatment', 'eDesc': 'Patients have the right to refuse medical treatment, even if healthcare providers believe it is in their best interest. This refusal should be respected, and alternative options or consequences should be discussed.', 'yTerm': 'Yuungcaasqumanritellerkaq', 'yDesc': "Iinrivigtellriit piunarqucingqertut ciuniunricugngaluki yuungcaryarateng, calricaariurtet ukvengraatki assirniluku taumun. Ciuniurinritleq qigcikumaarkauguq, cali qalarutkarkaugut allaggun yuungcallerkamek wall' qaillun piciqellranek ciuniurumanrilkan yuungcarrsuutekaa.   ", 'speakers': [], 'resourceID': '8'}, {'eTerm': 'Cultural Competence', 'eDesc': 'Autonomy recognizes the importance of cultural competence in healthcare. Healthcare providers should be sensitive to the cultural backgrounds of their patients and adapt their approach to treatment accordingly. ', 'yTerm': "Yuuyaram At'uuyugngallra", 'yDesc': 'Ellminek ataniuryaram elitaqumaa arcaqaucia yuuyaraq calricaarmi.  Calricaariurtet elpekumarkaugait yuuyaraat iinrivigtellriit cali yungcarillermeggnun aturluki pinarqekan.', 'speakers': [], 'resourceID': '8'}, {'eTerm': 'Guardianship and Incapacity', 'eDesc': "In cases where a person lacks the capacity to make decisions for themselves, autonomy may involve appointing a legal guardian for them. Even in these situations, efforts should be made to understand and consider the individual's wishes and values.", 'yTerm': 'Aulukiyaraq cali Casciigalnguq', 'yDesc': "Kina yuk pillerkiurciigalkan ellminek, ataniuryaram ellminek ilaksugngaa qanercetaarvigkun aulukestekiilluku tauna.  Wat'nangraan, taringnarqerkauguq cali umyuaqluku yuum piyuutii arcaqakekngai-llu.", 'speakers': [], 'resourceID': '8'}, {'eTerm': 'Educating and Empowering Patients', 'eDesc': 'Autonomy involves empowering patients with information and resources to actively participate in their healthcare decisions. This includes providing education about their medical conditions, treatment options, and self-management strategies.', 'yTerm': 'Elicungcarluki Atanrurtelluki Inrivigtellriit', 'yDesc': 'Ellminek ataniuryaram ilakaa inrivigtellriit piyunarqucilirluki ilagaucugngallrit nallunairutnek ikayuutekanek-llu pillerkiurillratni calricaaramegnek. Ilakluki elicungcarluki naullutaitnek, yuungcarsutekaitnek, ellaitnek pillerkiuraita auluksaraitnek-llu.', 'speakers': [], 'resourceID': '8'}, {'eTerm': 'Precontemplation', 'eDesc': 'The person is not yet considering change. They may be unaware or in denial of a need for any change.', 'yTerm': 'Cimirngaicuklukuaq', 'yDesc': "Yuk umyuarturpeknani cimillerkaminek.  Aipagni tayima elpekenritaa wall' cimirnarqenricuklukuarluni. ", 'speakers': [], 'resourceID': '9'}, {'eTerm': 'Contemplation', 'eDesc': 'The person is aware of the need for change but is undecided. They may weigh the pros and cons of changing.', 'yTerm': 'Umyuartuuteksaraq', 'yDesc': 'Yuum elpekluku cimirnarqellni taugken nalirruggluni.  Yuvriryugngaat cimillerkam assillra assinritellra-llu.', 'speakers': [], 'resourceID': '9'}, {'eTerm': 'Preparation', 'eDesc': 'The person has decided to make a change. They may begin planning and taking small steps toward change.', 'yTerm': 'Upcaraq', 'yDesc': 'Yuk umyuangellruuq cimiryugluni. Ayagniriluni pillerkiuramek cimirnaluni cukaunani-llu ayagniqcaarluni cimillerkaminun.  ', 'speakers': [], 'resourceID': '9'}, {'eTerm': 'Action', 'eDesc': 'The person actively engages in behaviors to make the change they want. This stage involves the